window.docContents[250].resolve({"/Ch04GoalManagement/#common-failures-debugging":{"contents":"写 tactic 时，目标管理相关的 bug 往往表现为\"运行时没报错，但结果不对\"或\"莫名其妙的 internal error\"。以下是最常见的几类问题。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009目标管理","header":"6.8. 4.7 常见失败模式与调试","id":"/Ch04GoalManagement/#common-failures-debugging"},"/Ch11Aesop/#ch11-rule-types":{"contents":"aesop 对每个目标执行三阶段搜索：\n\n1. Normalization：执行 norm 规则，将目标化为标准形式2. Safe rules：执行 safe 规则——匹配即 commit，不分支不回溯3. Unsafe rules：尝试 unsafe 规则，每条产生一个搜索分支\n\n目标: a ∈ s ∩ t → a ∈ s\n  ├─ [norm] simp → 无变化\n  ├─ [safe] intro h               ← 假设 h : a ∈ s ∩ t\n  │   └─ [safe] exact h.1 → ✅   ← And.left 取出\n  └─ (unsafe 分支未展开)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 4 自动化内幕\u0009aesop：可配置的启发式搜索\u0009用法详解","header":"13.1.4. 规则类型：norm / safe / unsafe","id":"/Ch11Aesop/#ch11-rule-types"}});